{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f9163276cdbde968a4a5eacc0a5d07a57b4460c9ffe6dd86e87e2c8e6d7a4e8", "ja": "（今日は静香が出演する刑事ドラマの撮影だ。\n静香のエリート警視役、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（今天是静香出演的刑侦剧拍摄。真期待静香饰演精英警视的样子啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "302ba526240892286cfe7a91fa80e7427d70dae89f4cc0c688a17953b44fd699", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっと思ったんですけど。\n私、戦うような役が多くないですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，我刚才突然想到一件事。  \n我是不是经常演那种战斗类的角色？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1002_p", "source_sha256": "02acab9634115059e93793a5d34545c8fd244d9568e1ee9ecfbabc9e894e5a36", "ja": "言われてみれば……この前は軍人もやってたな。\nもしかして、嫌だったか？", "zh": "这么说来……上次还演了军人。\n难道你不喜欢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "06f88185a5bb7dcb3d27b129f000342788ce3e0f545fe76ede5e849d34f7ae80", "ja": "嫌なんて言ってません！　こうして役をいただけるのは\nありがたいことですから。もちろん全力でやります！", "zh": "我可没说讨厌！能像这样拿到角色，\n我其实很感激的。当然也会全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "2e2a70de8f0072cb27a888dfe302f6dca86a06dcf8e1d4cb8882e414ec85be9d", "ja": "ただ……お芝居での経験が、アイドル活動に活きてるか\nというと、少し疑問で……。", "zh": "不过……要说演戏的经历有没有对偶像活动起到作用，我还是有点怀疑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2d9eac9cece5d2218b8b077576329c0674fc02457a3d44979ba4baf218c2d88d", "ja": "そうだな……。ライバルと戦うという意味では、\n心構えは活かせるんじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊……。如果是从和竞争对手较量这个意义上来说，心理准备应该能派上用场吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "a3c2a958c40217329b21daeeaaa92ad49917a2b43cba168f3b15a9596bff2bae", "ja": "心構えですか？　確かに……。緊迫した状況でも\n冷静さを失わない強いメンタルは勉強になるかも……。", "zh": "是心理准备吗？确实……即使身处紧张的状况，也不失去冷静的坚强心态，或许值得学习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "a8b531c99ba44fca8daf7fa57ecde22828cdca578568401ccd80c046366907b2", "ja": "拳銃は命を奪うもの。それならアイドルは……\n歌で心を……！？　そういうことですね！", "zh": "手枪是夺走生命的东西。那偶像就是……用歌声俘获人心……！？原来是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0642_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8d2dfc0bec554f53461034987deaaca0faced8ea3199af9730ab061d737f8f7c", "ja": "あ、ああ！　そうだな！\nそういうことだ、多分……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊！没错！\n大概……就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
